        "notes": "ROHM UMH3N: two NPN digital transistors (DTC143T: 4.7 kOhm base resistor built in), SOT-363. The ESP32 auto-program pair: Tr1 (base DTR, emitter RTS) pulls EN low, Tr2 (base RTS, emitter DTR) pulls GPIO0 low, so esptool's DTR/RTS sequence resets the chip into its download mode and either line alone does nothing.",
